  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutIncorporationOfTheRespondentDescription id="f-4" contextRef="c-1">Not incorporated. Converted to a limited liability company, organized in Delaware on November 7, 2005.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutIncorporationOfTheRespondentDescription>
  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutPropertyOfTheRespondentHeldByReceiverOrTrusteeDescription id="f-5" contextRef="c-1">Not applicable</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutPropertyOfTheRespondentHeldByReceiverOrTrusteeDescription>
  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-6" contextRef="c-1">Transportation of natural gas in Colorado, Illinois, Indiana, Kansas, Missouri, Nebraska, Ohio, and Wyoming.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
